    <h2 class="sec" id="teaching">Teaching</h2>
    <p>Courses I currently teach at WHU:</p>
    <ul class="retro">
      <li><b>Microeconomics &amp; Business Experiments</b> <span class="venue">MBA</span><br>Microeconomic theory paired with hands-on business experiments for sharper decision-making.</li>
